{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2022-01-27 12:05:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY UTAH TO LAUNCH PROGRAM FOR CUSTOMERS TO AFFORDABLY REDUCE CARBON FOOTPRINT', 'text': 'SALT LAKE CITY, JAN. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOMINION ENERGY CUSTOMERS IN UTAH AND IDAHO WILL SOON HAVE A NEW AND AFFORDABLE WAY TO SIGNIFICANTLY REDUCE THEIR CARBON FOOTPRINT. THE CARBONRIGHT\xa0PROGRAM WILL ALLOW CUSTOMERS TO VOLUNTARILY OFFSET CARBON EMISSIONS FROM NATURAL GAS USE IN THEIR HOME OR BUSINESS BY SUPPORTING PROJECTS, INCLUDING IN UTAH, THAT REDUCE GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS.'}